### FilmFuse core-api - reporting (app-store UGC rules). Token: see me.http.
# targetType RATING | COMMENT | USER; reason SPAM | HARASSMENT | HATE | SEXUAL_CONTENT | SPOILERS | OTHER.
# 204 (repeats while open are idempotent); 404 unknown or not visible to you; 400 self-report.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-access-token-here
@ratingId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@userId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Report a rating
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"targetType": "RATING", "targetId": "{{ratingId}}", "reason": "SPOILERS", "details": "Ending in the first line"}

### Report a user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"targetType": "USER", "targetId": "{{userId}}", "reason": "HARASSMENT"}
